[[63,7,16384,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a lift.</p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584862\">5050B34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585214\">7055A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584553\">1058A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584248\">1056B82</a></p><p>1. Release the wiring harness from the retaining bands located below\nthe control units mounting bracket.</p><p>2. Undo the nut securing the CNG control unit earth lead.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Methane injection control unit earth</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">C62</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065951.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,16384,"<p>1. Undo the nut securing the earth lead on the engine compartment\nbulkhead.</p><p>2. Undo the nuts (2a) and withdraw the cable pass buffer (2b).</p><p>3. Pass the wiring harness in the engine compartment through the\nhole in the engine compartment bulkhead.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065952.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,16384,"<p><a href=\"#/2584356\">1048A32</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the methane pressure\nsensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Methane pressure sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K54</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections of the methane adjustment\nsolenoid.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Methane regulation solenoid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">L61A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Methane regulation solenoid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">L61B</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connection from the intake air temperature\nsensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Integrated air temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K43</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Disconnect the electrical connection from the fuel vapour recovery\nsolenoid.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Fuel vapour recovery solenoid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">L10</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>5. Disconnect the electrical connection for the upstream Lambda\nsensor on the catalyzer.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor on pre-catalyzer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K15</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>6. Disconnect the electrical connection from the butterfly position\nsensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>Throttle position sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K56</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>7. Disconnect the electrical connection from the idle actuator.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>Idle actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">N74</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065953.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,16384,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections for the ignition coil.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Ignition &#x27;coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A30</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection from the engine coolant\ntemperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Coolant temperature sender unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K45</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections for the methane injectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Methane injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">N72</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Disconnect the petrol injectors electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Injector junction</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">D81</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Release the wiring from the retaining bands.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065954.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,16384,"<p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) and release the wiring harness protection\n(1b).</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection for the rpm sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K46</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connection for the detonation sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Detonation sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K50</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Disconnect the electrical connector for the oil pressure sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Insufficient engine oil pressure (switch) sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K30</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>5. Disconnect the electrical connection for the starter motor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A20</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>6. Disconnect the electrical connection for the alternator.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>Alternator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A10</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>7. Disconnect the electrical connection for the timing sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K47</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>8. Disconnect the electrical connection on the air conditioning\ncompressor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>Air conditioning compressor &quot;on&quot;\nelectromagnet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">L20</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065955.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,16384,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the speedometer sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Speedometer sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K84</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection for the downstream Lambda\nsensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor on catalyzer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K17</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Open the wiring retaining band.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065956.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,16384,"<p>Lower the vehicle on the lift.</p><p>Remove the engine bay junction unit cover,\nthen release the control unit from the clips securing it to the mount.</p><p>1. Disconnect the engine bay junction unit electrical connection\n(1a), disconnect facia wiring harness connectors (1b) and (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">B1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Junction unit under dashboard</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">B2</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Front/engine coupling</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">D4</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fold the cable loom onto the power unit.</p><p>Release the wiring from the retaining clips\nin the battery cradle area, then remove it from the engine compartment.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065957.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,16384,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the wiring harness in the engine\ncompartment.</p><p>Close the wiring retaining bands on the\nbattery cradle.</p><p>Connect the dashboard cable loom connectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Front/engine coupling</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">D4</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Junction unit under dashboard</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">B2</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nengine bay control unit coupling.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">B1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the junction unit in its original position\nand do up the clips securing it to the protective cover.</p><p>Refit the cover for the junction unit\nin the engine compartment.</p><p>Raise the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nrear Lambda sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor on catalyzer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K17</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Close the wiring retaining band.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection of the\nspeedometer sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Speedometer sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K84</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nair conditioner compressor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Air conditioning compressor &quot;on&quot;\nelectromagnet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">L20</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the timing sensor electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K47</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nalternator.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Alternator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A10</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nstarter motor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A20</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\noil pressure sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Insufficient engine oil pressure (switch) sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K30</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\ndetonation sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Detonation sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K50</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nrpm sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K46</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Tighten the wiring loom protection retaining\nnuts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Lower the car from the ramp.</p><p>Connect the petrol injectors electrical\nconnection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Injector junction</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">D81</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the methane injectors electrical\nconnections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Methane injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">N72</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nengine coolant temperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Coolant temperature sender unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K45</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nignition coil.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Ignition &#x27;coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A30</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Secure the wiring using the retaining bands.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nidle actuator.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Idle actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">N74</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nbutterfly position sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Throttle position sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K56</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nupstream Lambda sensor on the catalyzer.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor on pre-catalyzer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K15</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nfuel vapour recovery solenoid.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Fuel vapour recovery solenoid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">L10</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nintake air temperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Integrated air temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K43</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connections for\nthe methane adjustment solenoid.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Methane regulation solenoid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">L61A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Methane regulation solenoid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">L61B</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the methane pressure sensor electrical\nconnection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Methane pressure sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K54</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584356\">1048A32</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Pass the wiring through the cable pass\nbuffer and then through the hole in the engine compartment bulkhead.</p><p>Tighten the nuts securing the cable pass\nbuffer to the engine compartment bulkhead.</p><p>Secure the earth lead to the engine compartment\nbulkhead using the nut.</p><p>Position the wiring under the control units\nmounting bracket and secure it by means of the retaining bands.</p><p>Secure the CNG control unit earth lead.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Methane injection control unit earth</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">C62</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584248\">1056B82</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584553\">1058A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585214\">7055A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584862\">5050B34</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"]]